     8582     field UnitCliQnty as decimal
     8583     field isMarking   as logical
     8584     field isArtic     as logical
     8585     field isWeight    as logical
     8586     field isVarWeight as logical
     8587     field isSelect    as logical
     8588     field markType    as character
     8589     field PieceTTH    as character
     8590     field PieceFact   as character
     8591     index pi  db-num doc-id LineNum
     8592     index gds-code gds-code
     8593     index sts stts sts
     8594     .
