     8597     field stts        as character
     8598     field sts-utd     as integer
     8599     field stts-utd    as character
     8600     field unit        as character
     8601     field unit-ext    as character
     8602     field site        as character
     8603     field box-qnty    as decimal
     8604     field gds-name    as character
     8605     field db-num      as integer
     8606     field doc-id      as integer
     8607     field LineNum     as integer
     8608     field GrayZone    as logical
     8609     field isMark      as logical
     8610     field isWeight    as logical
     8611     field marking-string as character
     8612     field old-sts     as integer
     8613     field weight      as character
     8614     index pi  doc-level   sts
     8615     index pi2 mark-parent sts
     8616     index pi3 unit-ext
     8617     index pi4 mark obj-type obj-code gds-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     8618     index part gds-code obj-type obj-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     8619     index gds-code gds-code
     8620     index obj obj-code obj-type
     8621     .
     8622   define temp-table tt-mark-line like ub.marking-lines
